+ MotionGradient is Painter

+ from RGBA
+ to RGBA

────────────────────
+ This
    - from
    - to

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

=? if rect.width <= 0 || rect.height <= 0
canvas.fill-gradient
    - rect
    - linear-gradient(Point(rect.x, rect.y), Point(rect.right, rect.bottom), from, to)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ motion-hue RGBA
    - index Index

motion-hues[index % motion-hues.length]

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ motion-glow MotionGradient
    - index Index

MotionGradient(motion-hue(index), motion-hue(index + 1))
